- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Blum can improve our relationships with our coalition partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and sfio_in_government = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not sfio_in_government: The SFIO is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if sfio_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 5; prs_relation += 5; prrrs_relation += 5

We have improved our relations with the Z, [+ prs_name +], and PRRRS, and reduced tensions with the coalition.


@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Blum supports the toleration arrangement with the bourgeois parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not sfio_toleration: The SFIO is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if: sfio_in_government = 0 and sfio_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5;

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions. 
